Limestone Mountains

Limestone mountains are difficult ground with strong [[stone|stone]]-quarrying potential.

Select a known hex to inspect its ground and available production. City placement shows its actual workplaces and the next worker’s yield; movement previews show the route’s actual arrival time. In Keryx, inspect nearby known ground with `keryx map`.

See [[catchment]], [[citizens]] and [[marching]].

**Mountains cannot be crossed.** Plan a route around them; nearby cities can still work their resources.

## Base production

Per hex, without buildings or mineral deposits. Each worker is one citizen group. The places shown are limits for each good; a worker does one job.

<!-- terrain-production -->
| Good | Worker places | Per worker per game day |
|---|---|---|
| [[stone]] | 2 | 2 |
<!-- /terrain-production -->

Buildings, deposits and refining can change these values. Check City production for this hex's actual output. See [[hex-production-buildings]].

